--[[
	Teleport GUI  (LocalScript)
	Put in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts

	Tabs:
	  Normal  - type a username / display name. A player card appears with
	            TELEPORT, SPECTATE and ESP buttons for that person.
	  Friends - your Roblox friends who are in the same server. Each row has
	            TP, SPECTATE and ESP buttons.
	  All     - one switch to ESP (chams) everyone in the server, plus a
	            toggle to show or hide the name tags above ESP'd players.

	Controls:
	  - Enter in the box teleports to the matched player
	  - Drag the title bar to move
	  - "-" minimizes, "x" hides it
	  - K (or RightShift) toggles show/hide

	ESP note:
	  ESP state lives in plain tables (espOn / espAll), completely separate
	  from the GUI. Closing or reopening the window never touches it, and
	  every time the window opens the buttons are re-synced from that state.
]]

